      "source_hash": "fcab86f5b6276942a000b2aef68c80d8e1589eb2e8f06241b4f4f3eaafef18c9",
      "markdown": "[academy-book-catalog.r1.final.json](library-file:fde1_bGliZmlsZV9EaGxFWmJJbThKbDBfRmozR19fMk13_FileDrive_73e3d24e44d881918a9b9622fd5a4193)",
